From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add V.SOL

Add the vendor prefix for Guangzhou V-Solution Telecommunication
Technology Co., Ltd. (V.SOL), a supplier of PON equipment such as the
V2801SG ONU.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1755,6 +1755,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: Voltafield Technology Corp.
   "^vot,.*":
     description: Vision Optical Technology Co., Ltd.
+  "^vsol,.*":
+    description: Guangzhou V-Solution Telecommunication Technology Co., Ltd.
   "^vscom,.*":
     description: VS Visions Systems GmbH
   "^vxt,.*":
